Package: fly-protocol
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: fly-protocol <noreply@example.com>
Depends: libc6
Recommends: chromium | chromium-browser | google-chrome-stable | brave-browser
Homepage: https://github.com/tribewarez/fly-protocol
Description: Nym mixnet browser client
 A desktop shell for the fly-protocol PWA. It serves the bundled web app on
 loopback and opens it in a Chromium-based browser's app window, routing
 requests through the Nym mixnet (Sphinx packets over the 5-hop path).
 .
 Only 127.0.0.1 is bound, and the file server refuses path traversal. The
 mixnet client is the same audited Nym WASM used by the browser build; this
 package does not bundle a browser, it uses the system one.
